# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Carries over the old-URL redirects from
# public/.htaccess: the old Duda site's pages and its sitemap.
#
# Left out on purpose:
# - http -> https and the www/apex host redirect: handled in Cloudflare.
# - /x/index.html -> /x/ and the folder trailing slash: Pages does both
#   itself for every built page.
/about        /about/              301
/contact      /contact/            301
/sitemap.xml  /sitemap-index.xml   301
